## 2026-09-24 13:00
I use my laptop as my desktop workstation via a USB-C dock, but I got tired of the poor thermals waking up the neighbors and leaving scorch marks on my desk, so I got a wire baking rack to stand it on for better ventilation, and it's *very* silly

## 2026-09-24 12:43
I've gotten so much more engagement with Midway Menagerie than I ever thought possible, and it's been really rewarding. We've been getting several submissions a month, and not just from the same people! Plus we've already got hosts lined up for October and November

